    <description>One record per failed Ezidebit debit (status D dishonoured or F fatal dishonour), keyed on the Ezidebit PaymentID. Holds the debit date the default runs from, the bank reason, Ezidebit&apos;s fee for the failed debit, the R4K dishonour fee charged for it, and the next successful payment on the contract.</description>
